x + 5 = 5 \\]\n\nNow, we need to determine the value of \\( f(0) \\):\n\\[ f(0) = 5 \\]\n\nTherefore, the correct statement is:\n\\[ \\boxed{D} \\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{D}","correct":true,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"intermediate_algebra:755"}
